zation bias at most 2^-64; SHA-256 is not used for cryptographic purposes; scenario の名前は鍵に入らない"},{"field":"simulation.replications","value":"independent; unit=replication","affects":"replications are independently initialized; cases sharing one replication are not independent statistical trials"},{"field":"simulation.multiplicity","value":"bonferroni; rows=0; alpha_before=none; alpha_after=none","affects":"two one-sided Clopper-Pearson errors are allocated to each probability-query case row; the reported confidence is simultaneous across these rows"},{"field":"simulation.nondeterminism","value":"reject-on-encounter","affects":"unresolved nondeterministic successor actions are not assigned probabilities or resolved by a fixed ordering"},{"field":"simulation.guarantee","value":"estimation-not-proof","affects":"statistical verdicts concern this model and load under the declared confidence; absence of sampled violations is not a safety proof"},{"field":"metrics.estimation","value":"point-estimate-only; unit=replication","affects":"点推定であり、全スケジュールの検証でも区間推定でもない。案件を独立な標本と数えず、反復ごとに観測して標本平均・最小・最大・標本数を出す。"},{"field":"quality.definition","value":"model-declarations","affects":"性質はモデルの評価条件であり現実の正しさの認定ではない。潜在は評価だけで読み、方策からは読まない。"},{"field":"quality.denominator","value":"all_arrivals_or_declared_property","affects":"arrivals は受付拒否・overflow・未完了・deadlockを含む全流入。0又は未確定の分母の比を0で埋めず理由つきnullとする。clock以外の計算切断もtruncatedにする。"},{"field":"quality.form","value":"ratio_of_expected_counts","affects":"期待件数の比であり比率の期待値でも条件付き確率でもない。分子が分母の部分集合かは検査しない。"},{"field":"quality.estimation","value":"ratio_of_sums_per_replication","affects":"ΣN/ΣDの点推定。標本は反復単位であり案件を独立標本としない。expected_countは既知hit件数、unknown_countは未確定件数の別標本。観測結末は観測停止時点の分類であり将来の到達確率ではない。区間推定でも全スケジュールの検証でもない。"},{"field":"quality.mean","value":"pooled-case-sample-mean","affects":"反復をまたいで案件をまとめた標本平均。打切りがあれば点推定は出さない。統計的な区間は計算しない。"}],"diagnostics":[],"bounds":{"cases":3,"live_tasks":3,"clock":20,"truncated":false},"simulation":{"attempted_replications":2,"